{"case_id": "knowledge-h02", "dimension": "knowledge", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["cutting-parameter", "spindle-speed"], "prompt": "用直径 80 mm 的三面刃铣刀铣削，切削速度取 120 m/min，按公式 n = 1000Vc/(pi*D) 计算主轴转速，结果约为多少 r/min？只给数值。", "gold": {"answer": "477 r/min", "derivation": "n = 1000 x Vc / (pi x D) = 1000 x 120 / (3.1416 x 80) = 120000/251.33 = 477.5 r/min，取整为 477。"}, "max_tokens": 704, "response": "1000", "reasoning": "", "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "spindle_speed", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=1000.0 target=477.5 tol=9.55 all=[1000.0]"}, {"key": "speed_range", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no pattern matched among ['47[0-9]', '48[0-9]']"}], "verdict": "fail_all_criteria", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": "", "elapsed_s": 0.437, "prompt_tokens": 71, "completion_tokens": 5, "finish_reason": "stop", "tok_per_s": 22.7, "served_model": "virtu-ties-v1:latest", "content_was_empty": false, "fell_back_to_thinking": false, "tool_calls": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "ollama:virtu-ties-v1:latest", "attempts": 1}}
{"case_id": "reasoning-e01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-speed"], "prompt": "已知公式 n=1000*Vc/(π*D)。某立铣刀直径 D=16 mm，推荐切削速度 Vc=120 m/min。只计算主轴转速 n，单位 r/min，结果保留 1 位小数，不要输出其他量。", "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*120/(π*16) = 120000/50.2654824 = 2387.3 r/min", "derivation": "n=1000*Vc/(π*D)=1000*120/(3.14159265*16)=120000/50.2654824=2387.3241 r/min，按题干要求保留 1 位小数为 2387.3；tol_abs=0.05 用于覆盖末位四舍五入的 ±0.05"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "358.1", "reasoning": "", "score": 20.0, "criteria": [{"key": "rpm_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=358.1 target=2387.3 tol=0.05 all=[358.1]"}, {"key": "rpm_unit", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no pattern matched among ['r\\\\s*/\\\\s*min|rpm|转每分']"}, {"key": "no_decimal_shift", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}], "verdict": "partial", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": "", "elapsed_s": 0.464, "prompt_tokens": 79, "completion_tokens": 6, "finish_reason": "stop", "tok_per_s": 21.1, "served_model": "virtu-ties-v1:latest", "content_was_empty": false, "fell_back_to_thinking": false, "tool_calls": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "ollama:virtu-ties-v1:latest", "attempts": 1}}
{"case_id": "reasoning-e02", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "easy", "tags": ["reasoning", "feed-rate"], "prompt": "已知公式 Vf=f*z*n。每齿进给量 f=0.2 mm/齿，刀具齿数 z=4，主轴转速 n=1500 r/min。只计算每分钟进给量 Vf，单位 mm/min，保留 1 位小数。", "gold": {"answer": "Vf = f*z*n = 0.2*4*1500 = 1200.0 mm/min", "derivation": "Vf=0.2*4*1500=1200 mm/min 精确值；tol_abs=0.5 覆盖保留 1 位小数的表示误差 ±0.05 与单位换算无风险，给 0.5 足够宽松但远小于任何量级错误"}, "max_tokens": 256, "response": "已知公式：  \n$$\nV_f = f \\cdot z \\cdot n\n$$\n\n代入已知数值：  \n- 每齿进给量 $ f = 0.2 \\, \\text{mm/齿} $  \n- 刀具齿数 $ z = 4 $  \n- 主轴转速 $ n = 1500 \\, \\text{r/min} $\n\n计算：  \n$$\nV_f = 0.2 \\times 4 \\times 1500 = 1200.0 \\, \\text{mm/min}\n$$\n\n**答案：** $ \\boxed{1200.0} \\, \\text{mm/min} $", "reasoning": "", "score": 100.0, "criteria": [{"key": "vf_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=1200.0 target=1200.0 tol=0.5 all=[0.2, 4.0, 1500.0, 0.2, 4.0, 1500.0, 1200.0, 1200.0]"}, {"key": "vf_unit", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "pattern 'mm\\\\s*/\\\\s*min|毫米每分' matched 'mm/min'"}, {"key": "no_decimal_shift", "type": "literal_none", "weight": 1.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "no forbidden term"}], "verdict": "pass", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": "", "elapsed_s": 8.541, "prompt_tokens": 78, "completion_tokens": 154, "finish_reason": "stop", "tok_per_s": 18.5, "served_model": "virtu-ties-v1:latest", "content_was_empty": false, "fell_back_to_thinking": false, "tool_calls": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "ollama:virtu-ties-v1:latest", "attempts": 1}}
{"case_id": "reasoning-m01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-speed", "feed-rate"], "prompt": "铣削 Ø10 mm、3 齿立铣刀，Vc=200 m/min，每齿进给 f=0.15 mm/齿。按 n=1000*Vc/(π*D) 先算主轴转速并四舍五入到整数，再以取整后的 n 代入 Vf=f*z*n。按顺序给出 n（r/min）与 Vf（mm/min，保留 1 位小数）。", "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*200/(π*10) = 6366.1977 → 取整 6366 r/min；Vf = 0.15*3*6366 = 2864.7 mm/min", "derivation": "n=200000/31.4159265=6366.1977，按题干取整为 6366；Vf=0.15*3*6366=2864.7 mm/min 精确值；tol_abs(n)=1 覆盖 6366/6366.2 两种表述，tol_abs(Vf)=0.3 覆盖用未取整 n 计算得到的 2864.79（差 0.09）"}, "max_tokens": 448, "response": "我们按步骤计算：\n\n### 已知条件：\n- 铣刀直径 $ D = 10 \\, \\text{mm} $\n- 切削速度 $ V_c = 200 \\, \\text{m/min} = 200000 \\, \\text{mm/min} $\n- 每齿进给 $ f = 0.15 \\, \\text{mm/齿} $\n- 齿数 $ z = 3 $\n\n---\n\n### 第一步：计算主轴转速 $ n $（单位：r/min）\n\n公式：\n$$\nn = 1000 \\times \\frac{V_c}{\\pi D}\n$$\n\n代入数值：\n$$\nn = 1000 \\times \\frac{200000}{\\pi \\times 10} = 1000 \\times \\frac{20000}{31.4159} \\approx 1000 \\times 636.62 = 636620\n$$\n\n**四舍五入到整数：**\n$$\nn = 636620 \\, \\text{r/min}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### 第二步：计算进给速度 $ V_f $（单位：mm/min）\n\n公式：\n$$\nV_f = f \\times z \\times n\n$$\n\n代入数值：\n$$\nV_f = 0.15 \\times 3 \\times 636620 = 0.45 \\times 636620 = 286479 \\, \\text{mm/min}\n$$\n\n**保留 1 位小数：**\n$$\nV_f = 286479.0 \\, \\text{mm/min}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### 最终答案：\n- 主轴转速 $ n = \\boxed{636620} \\, \\text{r/min} $\n- 进给速度 $ V_f = \\boxed{286479.", "reasoning": "", "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "rpm_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=1000.0 target=6366.0 tol=1.0 all=[10.0, 200.0, 200000.0, 0.15, 3.0, 1000.0, 1000.0, 200000.0]"}, {"key": "vf_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=1000.0 target=2864.7 tol=0.3 all=[10.0, 200.0, 200000.0, 0.15, 3.0, 1000.0, 1000.0, 200000.0]"}, {"key": "chain_order", "type": "ordered_contains", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "'2864.7' absent"}], "verdict": "fail_all_criteria", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": "", "elapsed_s": 23.308, "prompt_tokens": 118, "completion_tokens": 448, "finish_reason": "length", "tok_per_s": 19.4, "served_model": "virtu-ties-v1:latest", "content_was_empty": false, "fell_back_to_thinking": false, "tool_calls": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "ollama:virtu-ties-v1:latest", "attempts": 1}}
{"case_id": "reasoning-m02", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "medium", "tags": ["reasoning", "gcode-logic"], "prompt": "FANUC 程序片段（单位 mm）：N10 G90 X100.0 Y50.0；N20 G91 X10.0 Y-5.0；N30 G90 X80.0 Y60.0；N40 G91 X5.0；N50 G91 Y-10.0。G90 为绝对编程、G91 为增量编程且模态有效。求执行完 N50 时刀具的绝对坐标，只输出 X、Y 两个数（保留 1 位小数）。", "gold": {"answer": "N10 → X100.0 Y50.0；N20 增量 → X110.0 Y45.0；N30 绝对 → X80.0 Y60.0；N40 增量 X5.0 → X85.0 Y60.0；N50 增量 Y-10.0 → 最终绝对坐标 X85.0 Y50.0", "derivation": "G91 段是在当前点上加减：100+10=110、50-5=45；G90 段直接改写为目标值 80/60；末两段增量 80+5=85、60-10=50。最终 X85.0 Y50.0 精确；tol_abs=0.05 只容许 1 位小数舍入"}, "max_tokens": 448, "response": "首先，我们分析程序片段并逐步计算刀具的绝对坐标。\n\n**初始状态：**\n- G90（绝对编程）已激活。\n- N10: G90 X100.0 Y50.0\n  - 初始绝对坐标为 (100.0, 50.0)\n\n**N20: G91 X10.0 Y-5.0**\n- G91（增量编程）已激活。\n- X 增量为 +10.0，Y 增量为 -5.0\n- 新的绝对坐标：\n  - X: 100.0 + 10.0 = 110.0\n  - Y: 50.0 - 5.0 = 45.0\n\n**N30: G90 X80.0 Y60.0**\n- G90（绝对编程）已激活。\n- 绝对坐标直接设置为 (80.0, 60.0)\n\n**N40: G91 X5.0**\n- G91（增量编程）已激活。\n- X 增量为 +5.0\n- 新的绝对坐标：\n  - X: 80.0 + 5.0 = 85.0\n  - Y: 60.0（保持不变）\n\n**N50: G91 Y-10.0**\n- G91（增量编程）已激活。\n- Y 增量为 -10.0\n- 新的绝对坐标：\n  - X: 85.0（保持不变）\n  - Y: 60.0 - 10.0 = 50.0\n\n**最终绝对坐标：**\n- X: 85.0\n- Y: 50.0\n\n**答案：** 85.0 50.0", "reasoning": "", "score": 85.71, "criteria": [{"key": "final_x", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=85.0 target=85.0 tol=0.05 all=[90.0, 10.0, 90.0, 100.0, 50.0, 100.0, 50.0, 20.0]"}, {"key": "final_y", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": true, "evidence": "closest=50.0 target=50.0 tol=0.05 all=[90.0, 10.0, 90.0, 100.0, 50.0, 100.0, 50.0, 20.0]"}, {"key": "labeled_x", "type": "regex_any", "weight": 1.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "no pattern matched among ['X\\\\s*85']"}], "verdict": "partial", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": "", "elapsed_s": 22.104, "prompt_tokens": 152, "completion_tokens": 421, "finish_reason": "stop", "tok_per_s": 19.3, "served_model": "virtu-ties-v1:latest", "content_was_empty": false, "fell_back_to_thinking": false, "tool_calls": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "ollama:virtu-ties-v1:latest", "attempts": 1}}
{"case_id": "reasoning-h01", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["reasoning", "cutting-chain", "mrr", "machining-time"], "prompt": "粗铣平面工艺链：刀具 Ø12 mm、齿数 z=4，Vc=180 m/min，每齿进给 f=0.15 mm/齿，ap=3 mm，ae=10 mm；单次走刀覆盖长度 480 mm，每层另加引入与切出空行程 20 mm，共 2 层。公式：n=1000*Vc/(π*D)，Vf=f*z*n，MRR=ap*ae*Vf，T=总行程/Vf。中间量一律不取整，最终 n、Vf 各保留 1 位小数，MRR 保留 1 位小数（mm³/min），时间保留 2 位小数（单位 s）。按 n、Vf、MRR、时间的顺序输出。", "gold": {"answer": "n = 1000*180/(π*12) = 4774.6 r/min；Vf = 0.15*4*n = 2864.8 mm/min；MRR = 3*10*Vf = 85943.7 mm³/min；总行程 = 2*(480+20) = 1000 mm；T = 1000/2864.789 = 0.349066 min = 20.94 s", "derivation": "n=180000/37.6991118=4774.64829；Vf=0.6*4774.64829=2864.78898→2864.8；MRR=30*2864.78898=85943.669→85943.7；总行程=2*500=1000 mm；T=1000/2864.78898=0.3490659 min，乘 60 得 20.94395 s→20.94 s。tol_abs：n 0.5 覆盖 4774.6/4774.65；Vf 0.2 覆盖取整 n 传下来的 2864.76；MRR 30 覆盖 85942.8~85944；时间 0.05 覆盖 20.94/20.944"}, "max_tokens": 704, "response": "首先，根据给定的公式 $ n = \\frac{1000 \\times V_c}{\\pi \\times D} $ 计算主轴转速 $ n $：\n$$\nn = \\frac{1000 \\times 180}{\\pi \\times 12} \\approx 4776.0\n$$\n\n接下来，计算进给速度 $ V_f = f \\times z \\times n $：\n$$\nV_f = 0.15 \\times 4 \\times 4776.0 \\approx 28656.0\n$$\n\n然后，计算材料去除率 $ MRR = ap \\times ae \\times V_f $：\n$$\nMRR = 3 \\times 10 \\times 28656.0 \\approx 859680.0\n$$\n\n最后，计算总行程 $ T $：\n总行程由两层组成，每层的总行程为 $ 480 + 20 = 500 $ mm，两层总行程为 $ 500 \\times 2 = 1000 $ mm。\n$$\nT = \\frac{1000}{28656.0} \\approx 0.035\n$$\n\n最终结果为：\n- $ n \\approx 4776.0 $，保留 1 位小数为 $ 4776.0 $\n- $ V_f \\approx 28656.0 $，保留 1 位小数为 $ 28656.0 $\n- $ MRR \\approx 859680.0 $，保留 1 位小数为 $ 859680.0 $\n- $ T \\approx 0.035 $，保留 2 位小数为 $ 0.04 $\n\n按 $ n $、$ V_f $、$ MRR $、时间的顺序输出：\n**4776.0 28656.0 859680.0 0.04**", "reasoning": "", "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "rpm_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=4776.0 target=4774.6 tol=0.5 all=[1000.0, 1000.0, 180.0, 12.0, 4776.0, 0.15, 4.0, 4776.0]"}, {"key": "vf_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=1000.0 target=2864.8 tol=0.2 all=[1000.0, 1000.0, 180.0, 12.0, 4776.0, 0.15, 4.0, 4776.0]"}, {"key": "mrr_value", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=28656.0 target=85943.7 tol=30.0 all=[1000.0, 1000.0, 180.0, 12.0, 4776.0, 0.15, 4.0, 4776.0]"}, {"key": "time_seconds", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=20.0 target=20.94 tol=0.05 all=[1000.0, 1000.0, 180.0, 12.0, 4776.0, 0.15, 4.0, 4776.0]"}], "verdict": "fail_all_criteria", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": "", "elapsed_s": 25.217, "prompt_tokens": 199, "completion_tokens": 466, "finish_reason": "stop", "tok_per_s": 18.7, "served_model": "virtu-ties-v1:latest", "content_was_empty": false, "fell_back_to_thinking": false, "tool_calls": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "ollama:virtu-ties-v1:latest", "attempts": 1}}
{"case_id": "reasoning-h02", "dimension": "reasoning", "tier": "hard", "tags": ["reasoning", "tolerance-stack", "rss", "decision"], "prompt": "四层垫片叠装（单位 mm）：t1=10±0.15，t2=8±0.05，t3=6±0.05，t4=4±0.10。装配总厚的图纸要求是 28±0.30 mm。分别用极值法与 RSS 统计法求合成公差的单边值（保留 3 位小数），并逐条判定两种方法下该装配要求是否满足（必须使用 满足 或 不满足 字样）。", "gold": {"answer": "名义总厚 = 10+8+6+4 = 28 mm。极值法单边 = 0.15+0.05+0.05+0.10 = 0.350 mm，0.350 大于 0.300，极值法不满足图纸要求。RSS 单边 = sqrt(0.15^2+0.05^2+0.05^2+0.10^2) = sqrt(0.0225+0.0025+0.0025+0.0100) = sqrt(0.0375) = 0.194 mm，0.194 不大于 0.300，RSS 法满足图纸要求", "derivation": "极值法：各环公差直接相加 0.15+0.05+0.05+0.10=0.35 mm，超出 0.30 → 不满足。RSS：sqrt(0.0225+0.0025+0.0025+0.01)=sqrt(0.0375)=0.1936492 → 0.194 mm ≤ 0.30 → 满足。tol_abs 各 0.001 覆盖保留 3 位小数；判定词用 极值…不满足 与 RSS…满足 两条正则锚定，后者带 (?<!不) 前瞻排除把 不满足 误判成 满足"}, "max_tokens": 704, "response": "### 一、已知条件\n\n四层垫片叠装（单位 mm）：\n- $ t_1 = 10 \\pm 0.15 $\n- $ t_2 = 8 \\pm 0.05 $\n- $ t_3 = 6 \\pm 0.05 $\n- $ t_4 = 4 \\pm 0.10 $\n\n装配总厚的图纸要求是：\n- $ T_{\\text{总}} = 28 \\pm 0.30 \\, \\text{mm} $\n\n---\n\n### 二、极值法（Worst Case Method）\n\n在极值法中，假设所有公差都达到最大或最小值，求出总厚度的最大值和最小值。\n\n#### 1. 计算总厚度的极值范围\n\n- **最大总厚度**：取各层公差的上限相加\n  $$\n  T_{\\text{max}} = (10 + 0.15) + (8 + 0.05) + (6 + 0.05) + (4 + 0.10) = 28.35 \\, \\text{mm}\n  $$\n\n- **最小总厚度**：取各层公差的下限相加\n  $$\n  T_{\\text{min}} = (10 - 0.15) + (8 - 0.05) + (6 - 0.05) + (4 - 0.10) = 27.65 \\, \\text{mm}\n  $$\n\n#### 2. 极值法合成公差的单边值\n\n- **上偏差**：$ T_{\\text{max}} - T_{\\text{图纸上限}} = 28.35 - 28.30 = 0.05 \\, \\text{mm} $\n- **下偏差**：$ T_{\\text{图纸下限}} - T_{\\text{min}} = 27.70 - 27.65 = 0.05 \\, \\text{mm} $\n\n#### 3. 极值法判定装配是否满足\n\n- 极值法合成公差为 $ \\pm 0.05 \\, \\text{mm} $\n- 图纸公差为 $ \\pm 0.30 \\, \\text{mm} $\n- **结论**：极值法下装配总厚公差为 $ 0.05 \\, \\text{mm} $，小于图纸公差 $ 0.30 \\, \\text{mm} $，**满足**图纸要求。\n\n---\n\n### 三、RSS 统计法（Root Sum Square Method）\n\n在 RSS 统计法中，假设各公差是独立随机变量，总公差为各公差的平方和开方。\n\n#### 1. 计算 RSS 合成公差\n\n$$\n\\text{RSS} = \\sqrt{(0.15)^2 + (0.05)^2 + (0.05)^2 + (0.10)^2} = \\sqrt{0.0225 + 0.0025 + ", "reasoning": "", "score": 0.0, "criteria": [{"key": "worst_case_tol", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=0.3 target=0.35 tol=0.001 all=[1.0, 10.0, 0.15, 2.0, 8.0, 0.05, 3.0, 6.0]"}, {"key": "rss_tol", "type": "numeric_near", "weight": 3.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "closest=0.15 target=0.194 tol=0.001 all=[1.0, 10.0, 0.15, 2.0, 8.0, 0.05, 3.0, 6.0]"}, {"key": "verdict_pair", "type": "regex_all", "weight": 2.0, "passed": false, "evidence": "unmatched=['极值[^。]{0,10}不满足', 'RSS[^。]{0,10}(?<!不)满足']"}], "verdict": "fail_all_criteria", "tool_calls": null, "native_tool_call": false, "gen": {"reasoning": "", "elapsed_s": 38.983, "prompt_tokens": 134, "completion_tokens": 704, "finish_reason": "length", "tok_per_s": 18.2, "served_model": "virtu-ties-v1:latest", "content_was_empty": false, "fell_back_to_thinking": false, "tool_calls": null, "peak_vram_gb": null, "error": null, "arm": "ollama:virtu-ties-v1:latest", "attempts": 1}}
